summary.label:
Funwear app is a kind of life health app that records exercise track and movement record with exercise bracelet.
1. Exercise: you can set daily exercise goals and check the activity amount such as the calorie distance of today's steps.
2. Exercise: measure and record the exercise data in real time, and provide weekly or monthly exercise trend chart to make the exercise situation clear at a glance;
3. Sleep: it can detect sleep data, record the length of deep sleep and light sleep, and help users to understand their sleep situation in real time;
4. Notice: after connecting the bracelet, set the bracelet, which can be used for many personalized settings, such as call reminder, intelligent alarm clock, long sitting reminder, step target, etc., to provide more convenience for users' life;
